# SHUTTERBUG: bulbs (charge crystals) drift toward the ship only slowly
# while B is held, and fly to it from across the screen once B is let go.
# Each is half the camera's meter: two fill it.
game shutterbug
cheat run 1
cheat quiet
cheat stop
cheat clear
cheat pos 40 84
cheat flash 0
cheat drop 0 290 84
hold B
wait 60
expect crystals == 1
expect crystal_dx > 200
release B
wait 90
expect crystals == 0
expect crystals_got == 1
expect flash >= 660
expect flash < 1320
cheat drop 0 290 60
wait 100
expect crystals_got == 2
expect flash == 1320
